0..76 Comment "// A seat\'s protocol run between two endpoints (Honda, Vasconcelos and Kubo,"
77..135 Comment "// _Language Primitives and Type Discipline for Structured"
136..212 Comment "// Communication-Based Programming_, doi:10.1007/BFb0053567): `fork` opens a"
213..286 Comment "// channel at the seat\'s session type, the forked side serves it, and the"
287..350 Comment "// desk drives its dual through every branch the seat may take."
